          "start": 2443
        },
        "quote": "(9) If the applicant is requesting street closures, written notice must be provided as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.050:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.70.050 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "f7bef43f-2c49-54d4-a13f-18309b2c981e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2740,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.050:block:27",
          "start": 2539
        },
        "quote": "(i) If the applicant is requesting street closures for a block party, the applicant shall provide written notice to all residents within the blockaded area at least 10 business days prior to the event.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.050:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.70.050 block 28",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 28,
          "component_id": "58ceee14-0d4c-5079-aa7f-6929b49e2038",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3233,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.050:block:28",
          "start": 2741
        },
        "quote": "(ii) If the applicant is requesting street closures in any other situation, the applicant shall provide written notice at least 10 business days prior to the event to: (A) all residents and/or businesses that may be affected by the street closures; and (B) any business improvement district established pursuant to K.S.A. 12-1781 et seq., in care of its board president (as well as the Executive Director of Downtown Topeka, Inc. (“DTI”) if within the downtown business improvement district).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.050:block:28#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
