        "quote": "(10) Acknowledgment by the applicant that any event staff or volunteers shall be at least 18 years of age and must be able to safely perform essential physical tasks, including standing for extended periods and moving light to moderately heavy equipment (such as barricades), with or without reasonable accommodation, and shall act under the direction and supervision of the applicant when assisting with the following activities: the placement, removal, relocation, or monitoring of signage, barricades, fencing, cones, and other traffic control devices; directing vehicular or pedestrian traffic; monitoring ingress and egress points; providing crowd control; assisting with event setup and teardown; maintaining event perimeters; supporting parking operations; and performing other duties reasonably related to the safe, orderly, and lawful conduct of the event. The City does not provide event staff or volunteers for events. The applicant is responsible for acquiring all necessary event staff or volunteers.",
